ready: 1
kind: term
id: trust.term.trust-tier
module: trust
name: Trust tier
definition: >-
  How directly a memory rests on the person or on the agent's own observation: principal (the
  person's words), first-party (outcomes the agent observed), agent-inferred (the agent's own
  conclusions), or third-party (outside content).
synonyms:
  - source trust
